  m_text: 'This is an exciting mobile game where your task is to move the platforms
    so that the ball can get to the right place. You control platforms that move
    in different directions to direct the ball to the goal.

    -------------------------------

    Each
    level of the game becomes more and more difficult as the number of platforms
    and obstacles increases and the speed of the ball accelerates. You have to be
    fast and accurate to avoid mistakes and score maximum points.  '
